{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21199","headline":"三月二十四日宿曾峰馆夜对桐花寄乐天 · 元稹","name":"三月二十四日宿曾峰馆夜对桐花寄乐天","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微月照桐花，月微花漠漠。\n怨澹不胜情，低回拂帘幕。\n叶新阴影细，露重枝条弱。\n夜久春恨多，风清暗香薄。\n是夕远思君，思君瘦如削。\n但感事睽违，非言官好恶。\n奏书金銮殿，步屣青龙阁。\n我在山馆中，满地桐花落。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}